    "title": "String search wildcard characters",
    "name": "Search string LIKE wildcard characters",
    "status": "active",
    "description": "The characters a SQL LIKE pattern treats specially (%, _ and \\) match themselves in string searches. Each fixture has a decoy that an unescaped pattern would also match: 100% next to 1000, Mary_Ann next to Mary-Ann and Back\\slash next to Backslash. Default (prefix), :contains and :exact are covered, plus a value that is only a wildcard character: as a prefix it matches nothing, with :contains only the name that holds the character.",
